### 가입
POST http://localhost:4011/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bomi@example.com",
  "password": "club2026!"
}

### 맞는 비밀번호로 로그인
POST http://localhost:4011/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bomi@example.com",
  "password": "club2026!"
}

### 틀린 비밀번호로 로그인
POST http://localhost:4011/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bomi@example.com",
  "password": "club2025!"
}

### 가입하지 않은 이메일로 로그인
POST http://localhost:4011/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nobody@example.com",
  "password": "club2026!"
}

### 비밀번호 없이 로그인
POST http://localhost:4011/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bomi@example.com"
}
